  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temp Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>🌡️ Pixel Temp Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">°C → °F: (x × 9/5) + 32</p>\n    <p class=\"formula\">°F → °C: (x − 32) × 5/9</p>\n    <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n    <select id=\"direction\">\n      <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n      <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n    </select>\n    <button id=\"convert\">Convert</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\">--</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": "/* Pixel-style palette: deep navy, teal, coral, cream, gold */\n:root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #f5f5f5;\n  --gold: #ffd166;\n  --focus: #4cc9f0;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #0f0f1a 25%, transparent 25%),\n                    linear-gradient(-45deg, #0f0f1a 25%, transparent 25%);\n  background-size: 8px 8px;\n  font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0f0f1a;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.3rem;\n  margin: 0 0 4px;\n  color: var(--gold);\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n.formula {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: #a0a0b0;\n  text-align: center;\n}\nlabel {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: var(--gold);\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 3px solid #0f0f1a;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  background: #0f0f1a;\n  color: var(--text);\n  outline: none;\n  width: 100%;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n  border-color: var(--focus);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--focus);\n}\ninput:hover, select:hover {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n}\nbutton {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  transition: transform 0.05s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ff5c77; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); background: #c7354f; }\n#result {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--gold);\n  background: #0f0f1a;\n  border: 3px solid #0f0f1a;\n  padding: 12px;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n  min-height: 2.5rem;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.1rem; }\n  #result { font-size: 1.3rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "app.js",
      "content": "const input = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst direction = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = input.value.trim();\n  if (raw === '') {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  const x = Number(raw);\n  if (!Number.isFinite(x)) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  let out;\n  if (direction.value === 'c-to-f') {\n    out = x * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    out = (x - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n  result.textContent = out.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\ninput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') convert();\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel-Style Temperature Converter\n\nA tiny, offline, pixel-art themed temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No packages, no network requests, no storage.\n\n## Run\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. That's it.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Enter a temperature in the **Temperature** field.\n2. Choose a direction: **Celsius → Fahrenheit** or **Fahrenheit → Celsius**.\n3. Click **Convert** (or press Enter).\n4. The result appears with exactly two decimals, without units.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Error Behavior\n\nEmpty input, non-numeric text, `NaN`, or non-finite values (`Infinity`) display exactly `Error`.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and controls\n- `styles.css` — pixel-style theme\n- `app.js` — conversion logic\n- `README.md` — this file\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Offline only; no imports, packages, network calls, external assets, iframes, or storage.\n- All controls are labeled and keyboard-accessible.\n- Works from 360px wide.\n- Under 200 lines total.\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
